msgstr "Kamera yakasarudzwa haigone kuvhurwa"

#: src/onboarding.py:582
msgid "Try to select another one"
msgstr "Edza kusarudza imwe"

#: src/onboarding.py:597
msgid ""
"Please visit\n"
"<a href=\"https://github.com/EmixamPP/linux-enable-ir-emitter\">https://"
"github.com/EmixamPP/linux-enable-ir-emitter</a>\n"
"to enable your ir emitter"
msgstr ""
"Ndapota shanya\n"
"<a href=\"https://github.com/EmixamPP/linux-enable-ir-emitter\">https://"
"github.com/EmixamPP/linux-enable-ir-emitter</a>\n"
"kugonesa emitter yako"

#: src/onboarding.py:665
msgid "Setup lighting 1"
msgstr "Kugadzira mwenje 1"

#: src/onboarding.py:666
msgid "Setup lighting 2"
msgstr "Kugadzira mwenje 2"

#: src/onboarding.py:707
msgid "Can't save face model"
msgstr "Haikwanisi kuchengetedza chimiro chechiso"

#: src/onboarding.py:712 src/onboarding.py:759
msgid "Scan second model"
msgstr "Scan muenzaniso wechipiri"

#: src/onboarding.py:718
msgid "Couldn't record the second model"
msgstr "Hatina kukwanisa kurekodha modhi yechipiri"

#: src/onboarding.py:719
msgid ""
"Your first model is saved, so face login already works. The room must still "
"be bright enough to see your face — change the light rather than turning it "
"off — then try again, or skip and add a model later from Settings."
msgstr ""
"Yako yekutanga modhi yakachengetwa, saka face login yatoshanda. Imba yacho "
"inofanira kunge ichiri kupenya zvakakwana kuti uone chiso chako - shandura "
"mwenje pane kudzima - woedza zvakare, kana kusvetuka wowedzera modhi gare "
"gare kubva kuZvirongwa."

#: src/onboarding.py:753
msgid "Second scan: glasses, facial hair or different lighting"
msgstr "Skani yechipiri: magirazi, ndebvu kana chiedza chakasiyana"

#: src/onboarding.py:755
msgid ""
"First model saved: face login already works. A second model makes "
"recognition more reliable when something changes: put on the glasses you "
"sometimes wear (or take them off), or record it with different facial hair, "
"and change the light — turn a lamp on or off, move away from the window. "
"Keep your face clearly visible and press Scan again; the same short guided "
"capture follows."
msgstr ""
"Muenzaniso wekutanga wachengetedzwa: kupinda nechiso kwave kushanda. "
"Muenzaniso wechipiri unoita kuti kuzivikanwa kuvimbike kana chimwe chinhu "
"chikachinja: pfeka magirazi aunombopfeka (kana ubvise), rekodha nendebvu "
"dzakasiyana, uye chinja chiedza — batidza kana dzima rambi, bva pahwindo. "
"Chengeta chiso chako chichionekwa zvakajeka uye dzvanya Skani zvakare; "
"kutora kupfupi kunotungamirirwa kwakafanana kunotevera."

#: src/onboarding.py:797
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> Checking TPM hardware and tools..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello inogona kuvhura otomatiki {} yako uchishandisa huchokwadi "
"hwechiso (wallet yakawanikwa: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> Kutarisa TPM hardware uye maturusi..."

#: src/onboarding.py:817
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected. Installing <i>tpm2-tools</i> "
"automatically..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello inogona kuvhura otomatiki {} yako uchishandisa huchokwadi "
"hwechiso (wallet yakawanikwa: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware yaonekwa. Kuisa <i>tpm2-tools</i> "
"otomatiki..."

#: src/onboarding.py:829
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> Hardware TPM 2.0 active. Your password will be securely "
"sealed inside the TPM."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello inogona kuvhura otomatiki {} yako uchishandisa huchokwadi "
"hwechiso (wallet yakawanikwa: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> Hardware TPM 2.0 inoshanda. Password yako ichavharwa "
"zvakachengeteka mukati meTPM."

#: src/onboarding.py:831
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected, but automatic installation of "
"<i>tpm2-tools</i> failed. Run <code>sudo apt install tpm2-tools</code>. "
"Falling back to software-based credential caching."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello inogona kuvhura otomatiki {} yako uchishandisa huchokwadi "
"hwechiso (wallet yakawanikwa: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware yaonekwa, asi kuiswa kwe<i>tpm2-tools</i> "
"otomatiki kwatadza. Mhanya <code>sudo apt install tpm2-tools</code>. "
"Kudzokera kune software-based credential caching."

#: src/onboarding.py:833
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> No TPM hardware detected. Using software-based credential "
"caching (AES-256-GCM)."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello inogona kuvhura otomatiki {} yako uchishandisa huchokwadi "
"hwechiso (wallet yakawanikwa: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> Hapana TPM hardware yaonekwa. Kushandisa software-based "
"credential caching (AES-256-GCM)."

