#: src/main.ui:75
msgid ""
"Snapshots of your face that Ubuntu Hello compares against. Keep at least "
"two, recorded in different lighting."
msgstr ""
"Snapshots yechiso chako iyo Ubuntu Hello inofananidza inopesana. Chengeta "
"maviri, akarekodhwa muchiedza chakasiyana."

#: src/main.ui:97
msgid "Showing saved models for:"
msgstr "Kuratidza mhando dzakachengetwa dze:"

#: src/main.ui:137
msgid ""
"Only one face model is enrolled. Glasses, a change of facial hair or "
"different lighting change how your face looks to the camera, so a single "
"model can fail (for example in the evening under lamps). Add a second model "
"with glasses on or off, your other look, or in different light to keep "
"unlocking reliable."
msgstr ""
"Muenzaniso mumwe chete wechiso wakanyoreswa. Magirazi, kuchinja kwendebvu "
"kana chiedza chakasiyana zvinochinja mataridzire echiso chako kukamera, saka "
"muenzaniso mumwe chete unogona kukundikana (semuenzaniso manheru pasi "
"pemarambi). Wedzera muenzaniso wechipiri nemagirazi kana pasina, chimiro "
"chako chimwe, kana muchiedza chakasiyana kuti kuvhura kurambe kuchivimbika."

#: src/main.ui:146
msgid "Add a second model"
msgstr "Wedzera muenzaniso wechipiri"

