#: src/main.ui:445
msgid ""
"A desktop notification shows while Ubuntu Hello looks for your face, then "
"reports the result. Failed attempts stay in the notification list."
msgstr ""
"Chiziviso chedesktop chinoratidza uku Ubuntu Hello ichitsvaga chiso chako, "
"yobva yashuma mhedzisiro. Kutadza kuedza ramba uri muchirongwa chekuzivisa."

#: src/main.ui:476
msgid "Show notifications"
msgstr "Ratidza zviziviso"

#: src/main.ui:482
msgid ""
"One card per face-authentication attempt, updated in place with the result."
msgstr ""
"Kadhi rimwe pakuedza kwechokwadi kwechiso, rakagadziridzwa panzvimbo "
"nemhedzisiro."

#: src/main.ui:513
msgid "Notification sounds"
msgstr "Chiziviso chinonzwika"

#: src/main.ui:519
msgid "Play the system sound for a recognized or failed attempt."
msgstr "Ridza kurira kwesistimu yekuedza kunozivikanwa kana kukundikana."

#: src/main.ui:550
msgid "Include diagnostics"
msgstr "Batanidzai diagnostics"

#: src/main.ui:556
msgid ""
"Add the model, certainty vs. threshold, frames, camera and timing to each "
"card. Useful when reporting a problem."
msgstr ""
"Wedzera iyo modhi, chokwadi vs. chikumbaridzo, mafuremu, kamera uye nguva "
"kune yega yega kadhi. Inobatsira pakutaura dambudziko."

#: src/main.ui:618 src/main.ui:734
msgid "Security"
msgstr "Chengetedzo"

#: src/main.ui:633
msgid ""
"How closely your face has to match, and whether Ubuntu Hello asks you to "
"confirm that you are really there."
msgstr ""
"Kuti chiso chako chinofanira kuenderana zvakadii, uye kana Ubuntu Hello "
"ichifanira kukukumbira kusimbisa kuti uripo chaizvo."

#: src/main.ui:657
msgid "Face match strictness"
msgstr "Kuoma kwekuenderana kwechiso"

#: src/main.ui:665 src/onboarding.ui:151
msgid "Fast"
msgstr "Inokurumidza"

#: src/main.ui:672 src/onboarding.ui:182
msgid "Balanced"
msgstr "Yakaenzana"

#: src/main.ui:680 src/onboarding.ui:213
msgid "Secure"
msgstr "Yakachengeteka"

#: src/main.ui:702 src/onboarding.ui:250
msgid "Ask me to nod to confirm"
msgstr "Ndikumbirwe kugutsurira musoro kusimbisa"

#: src/main.ui:708 src/onboarding.ui:259
msgid ""
"After your face matches, a notification asks you to nod. A photo held up to "
"the camera cannot nod."
msgstr ""
"Kana chiso chako chaenderana, chiziviso chinokukumbira kugutsurira musoro. "
"Mufananidzo wakabatwa pamberi pekamera haugoni kugutsurira musoro."

#: src/main.ui:771 src/onboarding.ui:759
msgid "Keyring / KWallet Auto-Unlock"
msgstr "Keyring / KWallet Auto-Vhura"

#: src/main.ui:786
msgid ""
"Enable face authentication to automatically unlock your login keyring or "
"KWallet on login. This securely stores your password sealed in the TPM when "
"available, or encrypted with AES-256-GCM using a root-only master key. Face "
"auth sets PAM_AUTHTOK for pam_gnome_keyring or pam_kwallet5 depending on "
"your desktop."
msgstr ""
"Gonesa kusimbiswa kwechiso kuti keyring yako yekupinda kana KWallet ivhurwe "
"yega paunopinda. Izvi zvinochengeta password yako zvakachengeteka, "
"yakavharirwa mu TPM kana iripo, kana yakavharidzirwa ne AES-256-GCM "
"uchishandisa kiyi huru ye root chete. Kusimbiswa kwechiso kunoisa "
"PAM_AUTHTOK ye pam_gnome_keyring kana pam_kwallet5 zvichienderana ne desktop "
"yako."

#: src/main.ui:814
msgid "Current Status:"
msgstr "Mamiriro Azvino:"

#: src/main.ui:823
msgid "Checking..."
msgstr "Kutarisa..."

#: src/main.ui:834
msgid "Enable Auto-Unlock"
msgstr "Bvisa Auto-Unlock"

#: src/main.ui:862
msgid "Keyring"
msgstr "Mhete yemakiyi"

#: src/main.ui:898
msgid "Display language"
msgstr "Mutauro wekuratidza"

#: src/main.ui:913
msgid "Automatic follows the system language. Changes apply immediately."
msgstr ""
"Otomatiki inotevera mutauro wehurongwa. Shanduko dzinoshandiswa pakarepo."

